---@field DeprecationDate? aws.storage_gateway.DeprecationDate Date after which this gateway will not receive software updates for new features and bug fixes.
---@field GatewayCapacity? aws.storage_gateway.GatewayCapacity Specifies the size of the gateway's metadata cache.
